WEBVTT

00:13:29.379 --> 00:13:31.045
Dok mi je kćerka bila

00:13:31.045 --> 00:13:34.497
između života i smrti,

00:13:34.497 --> 00:13:38.336
prošaputao sam ženi na uho:

00:13:38.336 --> 00:13:41.438
"Jesam li ja kriv za ovo što se desilo

00:13:41.438 --> 00:13:45.114
mojoj i tvojoj kćerci?"

00:13:45.114 --> 00:13:47.635
Odsečno mi je rekla:

00:13:47.635 --> 00:13:50.146
"Molim te, nemoj sebe da kriviš.

00:13:50.146 --> 00:13:53.362
Zauzeo si se za prave razloge.

00:13:53.362 --> 00:13:55.497
Rizikovao si svoj život

00:13:55.497 --> 00:13:56.900
za istinu,

00:13:56.900 --> 00:13:58.081
za mir

00:13:58.081 --> 00:14:00.189
i za obrazovanje.